{"unit_id":"NigelYao__dsh-view-modes#card-zh","repo":"NigelYao/dsh-view-modes","commit":"a57d237e03b6488875cb7cc2a90bf6a37512632d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DshViewModes（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness 提供详尽、普通和摘要三种对话展示模式。它通过浏览器端 bundle 接入会话标题栏和通用设置，可随时切换视图。详尽模式保留完整过程，普通模式按语义阶段折叠工具调用与思考，摘要模式突出回答并收起过程；过程标题可展开查看原始步骤。适合希望在调试、日常工作和查看结果时调整信息密度的 DSH Web 用户。需要 DSH Web 和支持的浏览器环境，不需要额外密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:875-919","client.js:996-1075"]}
{"unit_id":"NigelYao__dsh-view-modes#card-en","repo":"NigelYao/dsh-view-modes","commit":"a57d237e03b6488875cb7cc2a90bf6a37512632d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DshViewModes adds three DSH Web views: Verbose keeps the full trace, Normal folds related tools and thoughts into expandable groups, and Summary condenses activity around the answer. Switch modes from the session header or settings for debugging, daily work, or review. Requires DSH Web; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:875-919","client.js:996-1075"]}
