{"unit_id":"NigelYao__dsh-view-modes#feature-1","repo":"NigelYao/dsh-view-modes","commit":"a57d237e03b6488875cb7cc2a90bf6a37512632d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DshViewModes 的功能「normal」：普通模式按语义阶段把相关工具调用与思考折叠成过程组，助手正文作为分界保留；点击过程标题可查看原始步骤。（见 client.js:996-1075）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:996-1075"]}
{"unit_id":"NigelYao__dsh-view-modes#feature-2","repo":"NigelYao/dsh-view-modes","commit":"a57d237e03b6488875cb7cc2a90bf6a37512632d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DshViewModes 的功能「summary」：摘要模式在运行时收起过程内容并显示活动提示，完成后将过程整理为回答上方可展开的简要回顾。（见 client.js:315-342）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:315-342"]}
{"unit_id":"NigelYao__dsh-view-modes#feature-3","repo":"NigelYao/dsh-view-modes","commit":"a57d237e03b6488875cb7cc2a90bf6a37512632d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DshViewModes 的功能「switch」：用户可从会话标题栏或通用设置选择详尽、普通、摘要模式，也可用 Alt+1、Alt+2、Alt+3 快捷切换。（见 client.js:808-871）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:808-871"]}
{"unit_id":"NigelYao__dsh-view-modes#feature-4","repo":"NigelYao/dsh-view-modes","commit":"a57d237e03b6488875cb7cc2a90bf6a37512632d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DshViewModes 的功能「persist」：插件将所选模式保存到浏览器 localStorage，刷新后继续使用；首次使用默认为普通模式，并兼容迁移旧模式值。（见 client.js:190-207）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:190-207"]}
